    "created_at": "2017-01-30T09:06:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-30T09:06:58Z",
    "body": "`div.style` is described by https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#the-elementcssinlinestyle-interface. Which suggests https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#cssstyledeclaration describes the behavior. That currently doesn't say anything about mutating a DOM attribute, but that might very well be wrong.\r\n\r\n@zcorpan?",
