    "created_at": "2017-01-30T12:00:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-30T12:00:17Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think it would be better if all the algorithms that mutate a `CSSStyleDeclaration` actually invoked an algorithm that took care of serializing and mutating the style content attribute, if any.",
